    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Easy Tiger\" is the debut album by Kitty Durham, released on July 26, 2024, via Sunday Best Recordings. The album blends elements of rock, funk, and soul, showcasing Durham's dynamic vocal range and her ability to merge gritty rock & roll energy with smooth, soulful grooves. Over the course of its ten tracks, \"Easy Tiger\" explores themes of resilience, self-discovery, and emotional complexity, anchored by tight musicianship and a raw, authentic production style that highlights both vintage influences and contemporary flair.\n\nAs Kitty Durham's first full-length release, \"Easy Tiger\" marks a significant milestone in her career, following years of live performances and smaller releases that built her reputation as a compelling live act. The album was written, re-written, and recorded over a five-year period, reflecting a deep commitment to craft and personal expression. While specific critical reviews are not widely documented at this time, the album's release on vinyl and CD, as well as its distribution through major outlets, indicates strong industry support and anticipation. \"Easy Tiger\" positions Kitty Durham as a distinctive voice in the modern rock and soul landscape, offering a fresh take on genre traditions with a confident, individualistic approach.",
